<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dashboard Financeiro — Gui 2026–2028</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --bg: #f5f5f3; --bg2: #ffffff; --bg3: #f0f0ee;
    --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.08); --border2: rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
    --text: #111111; --text2: #555555; --text3: #999999;
    --green: #16a34a; --green-dim: rgba(22,163,74,0.10);
    --red: #dc2626; --red-dim: rgba(220,38,38,0.08);
    --amber: #b45309; --amber-dim: rgba(180,83,9,0.08);
    --blue: #1d4ed8; --blue-dim: rgba(29,78,216,0.08);
    --radius: 12px; --radius-sm: 8px;
  }
  body { background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; min-height:100vh; padding:24px; }
  .header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:32px; padding-bottom:24px; border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border); }
  .header-title { font-size:22px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.5px; }
  .header-sub { font-size:13px; color:var(--text2); margin-top:4px; }
  .phase-badge { background:var(--green-dim); color:var(--green); border:0.5px solid rgba(22,163,74,0.3); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:500; }
  .tabs { display:flex; gap:4px; margin-bottom:28px; background:var(--bg2); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:4px; width:fit-content; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .tab { padding:8px 16px; border-radius:6px; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; cursor:pointer; color:var(--text2); border:none; background:transparent; transition:all 0.15s; }
  .tab.active { background:var(--bg3); color:var(--text); }
  .tab:hover:not(.active) { color:var(--text); }
  .panel { display:none; }
  .panel.active { display:block; }
  .grid-4 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:12px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .grid-3 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .grid-2 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .card { background:var(--bg2); border:0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:18px 20px; }
  .card-title { font-size:11px; font-weight:500; color:var(--text3); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .metric { background:var(--bg3); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:14px 16px; }
  .metric-label { font-size:11px; color:var(--text2); margin-bottom:6px; }
  .metric-value { font-size:22px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.5px; }
  .metric-sub { font-size:11px; color:var(--text3); margin-top:4px; }
  .row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:9px 0; border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border); font-size:13px; }
  .row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .row-label { color:var(--text2); }
  .row-value { font-weight:500; }
  .slider-wrap { margin-bottom:16px; }
  .slider-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .slider-name { font-size:13px; color:var(--text2); }
  .slider-val { font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text); }
  input[type=range] { width:100%; height:4px; border-radius:2px; background:var(--bg3); outline:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; -webkit-appearance:none; appearance:none; }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance:none; width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--green); cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(22,163,74,0.2); }
  select { width:100%; background:var(--bg3); border:0.5px solid var(--border2); color:var(--text); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:10px 12px; font-size:13px; outline:none; cursor:pointer; }
  .result-box { background:var(--green-dim); border:0.5px solid rgba(22,163,74,0.25); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:16px 18px; margin-top:16px; }
  .result-box.warn { background:var(--amber-dim); border-color:rgba(180,83,9,0.25); }
  .result-box.danger { background:var(--red-dim); border-color:rgba(220,38,38,0.25); }
  .result-label { font-size:11px; color:var(--text2); margin-bottom:4px; }
  .result-number { font-size:32px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-1px; }
  .result-sub { font-size:12px; color:var(--text2); margin-top:4px; }
  .funnel-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border); }
  .funnel-item:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .funnel-num { font-size:24px; font-weight:700; min-width:60px; text-align:right; letter-spacing:-0.5px; }
  .funnel-info { flex:1; }
  .funnel-name { font-size:13px; color:var(--text); }
  .funnel-desc { font-size:11px; color:var(--text3); margin-top:2px; }
  .funnel-pct { font-size:12px; font-weight:500; min-width:36px; text-align:right; }
  .progress-wrap { margin-bottom:14px; }
  .progress-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .progress-label { color:var(--text2); }
  .progress-val { font-weight:500; }
  .progress-track { height:6px; background:var(--bg3); border-radius:3px; overflow:hidden; }
  .progress-fill { height:100%; border-radius:3px; transition:width 0.4s ease; }
  .phase-item { display:flex; gap:16px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .phase-line { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; }
  .phase-dot { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:4px; }
  .phase-connector { width:1px; background:var(--border); flex:1; margin-top:4px; }
  .phase-body { flex:1; padding-bottom:16px; }
  .phase-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .phase-title { font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }
  .phase-period { font-size:11px; color:var(--text3); margin-top:2px; }
  .phase-tag { font-size:11px; font-weight:500; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:20px; }
  .phase-text { font-size:13px; color:var(--text2); line-height:1.6; }
  .divida-input-wrap { margin-bottom:12px; }
  .divida-input-label { font-size:12px; color:var(--text2); margin-bottom:6px; }
  .divida-input { width:100%; background:var(--bg3); border:0.5px solid var(--border2); color:var(--text); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; font-weight:500; outline:none; }
  .divida-input:focus { border-color:rgba(22,163,74,0.4); }
  .badge { display:inline-block; font-size:11px; font-weight:500; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:20px; }
  .alert { border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:12px 14px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .alert.amber { background:var(--amber-dim); color:var(--amber); border:0.5px solid rgba(180,83,9,0.2); }
  .section-title { font-size:11px; font-weight:500; color:var(--text3); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:12px; margin-top:24px; }
  .section-title:first-child { margin-top:0; }
  .scenario-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:12px; }
  .scenario-card { background:var(--bg3); border:0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:14px 16px; }
  .scenario-name { font-size:12px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .scenario-desc { font-size:11px; color:var(--text3); margin-bottom:12px; line-height:1.5; }
  .scenario-result { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.5px; }
  .scenario-label { font-size:11px; color:var(--text2); margin-top:2px; }
  table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; }
  th { text-align:left; font-size:11px; color:var(--text3); font-weight:500; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border2); }
  td { padding:9px 0; border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border); color:var(--text2); }
  td:first-child { color:var(--text); }
  td:last-child { text-align:right; font-weight:500; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }
  @media (max-width:700px) { .grid-4,.grid-3 { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } .scenario-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } body { padding:16px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <div>
    <div class="header-title">Dashboard — Gui × Pertto</div>
    <div class="header-sub">Planejamento financeiro 2026–2028 · Atualizado manualmente</div>
  </div>
  <div class="phase-badge">Fase 1 — Estabilização</div>
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tab active" onclick="showPanel('funil',this)">Funil Beta</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="showPanel('comissao',this)">Simulador PME</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="showPanel('metas',this)">Metas & Fases</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="showPanel('dividas',this)">Dívidas</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="showPanel('estorno',this)">Risco de Estorno</button>
</div>

<!-- PANEL 1: FUNIL -->
<div class="panel active" id="panel-funil">
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Funil mensal — Beta SDR</div>
      <div class="slider-wrap">
        <div class="slider-header"><span class="slider-name">Ligações/mês pelo discador</span><span class="slider-val" id="ligs-out">800</span></div>
        <input type="range" min="200" max="3000" step="100" value="800" id="ligs" oninput="calcFunil()">
      </div>
      <div class="slider-wrap">
        <div class="slider-header"><span class="slider-name">Taxa de agendamento</span><span class="slider-val" id="agenda-out">5%</span></div>
        <input type="range" min="2" max="15" step="1" value="5" id="agenda" oninput="calcFunil()">
      </div>
      <div class="slider-wrap">
        <div class="slider-header"><span class="slider-name">Comparecimento</span><span class="slider-val" id="comp-out">40%</span></div>
        <input type="range" min="20" max="80" step="5" value="40" id="comp" oninput="calcFunil()">
      </div>
      <div class="slider-wrap">
        <div class="slider-header"><span class="slider-name">Conversão (reunião → venda)</span><span class="slider-val" id="conv-out">25%</span></div>
        <input type="range" min="5" max="60" step="5" value="25" id="conv" oninput="calcFunil()">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Resultado do funil</div>
      <div class="funnel-item">
        <div class="funnel-num" style="color:var(--blue);" id="f-ligs">800</div>
        <div class="funnel-info"><div class="funnel-name">Ligações</div><div class="funnel-desc">discador automático</div></div>
        <div class="funnel-pct" style="color:var(--text3);">100%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="funnel-item">
        <div class="funnel-num" style="color:var(--amber);" id="f-agend">40</div>
        <div class="funnel-info"><div class="funnel-name">Agendadas</div><div class="funnel-desc">reuniões marcadas pela SDR</div></div>
        <div class="funnel-pct" style="color:var(--amber);" id="f-agend-pct">5%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="funnel-item">
        <div class="funnel-num" style="color:var(--amber);" id="f-reais">16</div>
        <div class="funnel-info"><div class="funnel-name">Realizadas</div><div class="funnel-desc">comparecimento confirmado</div></div>
        <div class="funnel-pct" style="color:var(--amber);" id="f-reais-pct">40%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="funnel-item">
        <div class="funnel-num" style="color:var(--green);" id="f-vendas">4</div>
        <div class="funnel-info"><div class="funnel-name">Vendas fechadas</div><div class="funnel-desc">por Gui</div></div>
        <div class="funnel-pct" style="color:var(--green);" id="f-vendas-pct">25%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-box" id="funil-result">
        <div class="result-label">Vendas/mês projetadas</div>
        <div class="result-number" style="color:var(--green);" id="funil-num">4</div>
        <div class="result-sub">Meta R$ 10k → <span id="funil-meta-v">1</span> venda/mês a ticket R$ 10k</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-title">Custo do Beta</div>
  <div class="grid-4">
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">SDR PJ</div><div class="metric-value">R$ 1.000</div><div class="metric-sub">por mês</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Discador (rateado)</div><div class="metric-value">R$ 142</div><div class="metric-sub">R$ 1.700/ano</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Custo total Beta</div><div class="metric-value" style="color:var(--amber);">R$ 1.142</div><div class="metric-sub">por mês</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Break-even</div><div class="metric-value" style="color:var(--green);">1 venda</div><div class="metric-sub">a qualquer ticket</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PANEL 2: SIMULADOR PME -->
<div class="panel" id="panel-comissao">
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Parâmetros da venda</div>
      <div class="slider-wrap">
        <div class="slider-header"><span class="slider-name">Ticket mensal da empresa (R$)</span><span class="slider-val" id="ticket-out">R$ 10.000</span></div>
        <input type="range" min="3000" max="30000" step="500" value="10000" id="ticket" oninput="calcComissao()">
      </div>
      <div class="slider-wrap">
        <div class="slider-header"><span class="slider-name">Vendas fechadas no mês</span><span class="slider-val" id="vendas-out">4 vendas</span></div>
        <input type="range" min="1" max="12" step="1" value="4" id="vendas" oninput="calcComissao()">
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="slider-name" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Operadora</div>
        <select id="operadora" onchange="calcComissao()">
          <option value="3.2,0.9,0.9">Bradesco PME Porte I (320%)</option>
          <option value="3.1,0.8,0.9">Bradesco PME Porte II (310%)</option>
          <option value="2.5,0.9,0.6" selected>Amil / SulAmérica (250%)</option>
          <option value="2.5,0.9,0.6">Alice (250%)</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="slider-name" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Churn mensal esperado</div>
        <select id="churn" onchange="calcComissao()">
          <option value="0">0% — sem cancelamentos</option>
          <option value="0.05" selected>5% — 1 em 20 empresas</option>
          <option value="0.10">10% — 1 em 10 empresas</option>
          <option value="0.20">20% — alto risco</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Comissão por parcela</div>
      <div class="row"><span class="row-label">1ª parcela (100% do prêmio × vendas)</span><span class="row-value" style="color:var(--green);" id="c1">—</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="row-label">2ª parcela</span><span class="row-value" id="c2">—</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="row-label">3ª parcela</span><span class="row-value" id="c3">—</span></div>
      <div class="result-box" id="com-result-box">
        <div class="result-label">Receita estabilizada/mês (a partir do 3º mês)</div>
        <div class="result-number" style="color:var(--green);" id="com-estab">—</div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;" class="result-box warn">
        <div class="result-label">Com churn aplicado</div>
        <div class="result-number" style="color:var(--amber);" id="com-churn">—</div>
        <div class="result-sub">receita líquida real esperada</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-title">Cenários fixos — 4 vendas/mês</div>
  <div class="scenario-grid">
    <div class="scenario-card" style="border-color:rgba(220,38,38,0.2);">
      <div class="scenario-name" style="color:var(--red);">Conservador</div>
      <div class="scenario-desc">Ticket R$ 5k · Amil 250% · 4 vendas</div>
      <div class="scenario-result" style="color:var(--red);">~R$ 8.500</div>
      <div class="scenario-label">estabilizado/mês</div>
    </div>
    <div class="scenario-card" style="border-color:rgba(29,78,216,0.3);">
      <div class="scenario-name" style="color:var(--blue);">Realista ✓</div>
      <div class="scenario-desc">Ticket R$ 10k · Amil 250% · 4 vendas</div>
      <div class="scenario-result" style="color:var(--blue);">~R$ 18.000</div>
      <div class="scenario-label">estabilizado/mês</div>
    </div>
    <div class="scenario-card" style="border-color:rgba(22,163,74,0.3);">
      <div class="scenario-name" style="color:var(--green);">Otimista</div>
      <div class="scenario-desc">Ticket R$ 20k · Bradesco 320% · 4 vendas</div>
      <div class="scenario-result" style="color:var(--green);">~R$ 40.000</div>
      <div class="scenario-label">estabilizado/mês</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:16px;" class="alert amber">⚠ Churn nos primeiros 3 meses gera estorno de comissão. Foque em empresas que já usam plano e querem reduzir custo.</div>
</div>

<!-- PANEL 3: METAS -->
<div class="panel" id="panel-metas">
  <div class="grid-4" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Salário fixo</div><div class="metric-value">R$ 3.000</div><div class="metric-sub">PF · All + CMT</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Custo de vida</div><div class="metric-value" style="color:var(--red);">R$ 6.000</div><div class="metric-sub">mensal total</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">SUSEP</div><div class="metric-value" style="color:var(--amber);">Ago/26</div><div class="metric-sub">início das aulas</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Abertura Pertto</div><div class="metric-value" style="color:var(--green);">2028</div><div class="metric-sub">com SUSEP em mãos</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-title">Linha do tempo</div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="phase-item">
      <div class="phase-line"><div class="phase-dot" style="background:var(--red);"></div><div class="phase-connector"></div></div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div><div class="phase-title">Fase 1 — Estabilização</div><div class="phase-period">Jul–Dez 2026 · 6 meses</div></div>
          <span class="phase-tag" style="background:var(--red-dim);color:var(--red);">Meta R$ 10k comissão/mês</span>
        </div>
        <div class="phase-text">Cobrir custo de vida com folga e amortizar dívidas urgentes. Lançar Beta SDR com 1 PJ + discador.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--red-dim);color:var(--red);">Iniciar SUSEP</span>
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--red-dim);color:var(--red);">Lançar Beta SDR</span>
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--red-dim);color:var(--red);">Quitar urgentes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-item">
      <div class="phase-line"><div class="phase-dot" style="background:var(--amber);"></div><div class="phase-connector"></div></div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div><div class="phase-title">Fase 2 — Quitação</div><div class="phase-period">Jan–Dez 2027 · 12 meses</div></div>
          <span class="phase-tag" style="background:var(--amber-dim);color:var(--amber);">Meta R$ 18k comissão/mês</span>
        </div>
        <div class="phase-text">Quitar todas as dívidas (~R$ 185k) e concluir SUSEP. R$ 3k fixo + R$ 18k = R$ 21k → R$ 15k/mês para dívidas.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--amber-dim);color:var(--amber);">Concluir SUSEP</span>
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--amber-dim);color:var(--amber);">Zerar dívidas</span>
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--amber-dim);color:var(--amber);">Escalar PME</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-item">
      <div class="phase-line"><div class="phase-dot" style="background:var(--green);"></div><div class="phase-connector"></div></div>
      <div class="phase-body">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div><div class="phase-title">Fase 3 — Acumulação + Pertto</div><div class="phase-period">Jan–Dez 2028 · 12 meses</div></div>
          <span class="phase-tag" style="background:var(--green-dim);color:var(--green);">Meta R$ 25k comissão/mês</span>
        </div>
        <div class="phase-text">SUSEP em mãos, zero dívidas. Abrir a Pertto. R$ 28k/mês → guarda R$ 22k/mês → acumula ~R$ 264k de runway.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--green-dim);color:var(--green);">Abrir Pertto</span>
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--green-dim);color:var(--green);">6–9 meses runway</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-item" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <div class="phase-line"><div class="phase-dot" style="background:var(--blue);"></div></div>
      <div class="phase-body" style="padding-bottom:0;">
        <div class="phase-header">
          <div><div class="phase-title">Pertto em escala</div><div class="phase-period">2029 em diante</div></div>
          <span class="phase-tag" style="background:var(--blue-dim);color:var(--blue);">Meta R$ 50k faturamento</span>
        </div>
